Instead, I'm gonna sweep your trap away

248
00:13:47,540 --> 00:13:49,560
with Harpy's Feather Duster.

249
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:05,800
The hidden card I played
was the Spellbinding Circle.

250
00:14:06,080 --> 00:14:09,817
If you had declared an attack, your
harpy would have been snared in the trap.

251
00:14:09,900 --> 00:14:11,540
Very clever of you, Mai.

252
00:14:11,980 --> 00:14:13,840
I do appreciate the compliment.

253
00:14:14,220 --> 00:14:15,808
Keep your eyes on me, Yugi.

254
00:14:16,500 --> 00:14:18,560
I might teach you a thing or two.

255
00:14:19,140 --> 00:14:21,460
Mai still has that mirror wall in play.

256
00:14:21,780 --> 00:14:25,117
I can't attack without my
monster's power being cut in half.

257
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:26,860
I need to alter my strategy.

258
00:14:28,900 --> 00:14:31,120
I'll switch Skull to defense mode.

259
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:37,220
And to finish my move, I'll also
play the Feral Imp in defense.

260
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:44,847
Not much else you can do, is there, Yugi,
since I've left you no way to attack.

261
00:14:44,940 --> 00:14:45,800
My turn now.

262
00:14:46,220 --> 00:14:49,900
I play Rose Whip to raise
my monster's attack power.

263
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:58,317
She keeps powering Harpy Lady and hiding
behind that mirror wall as a shield.

264
00:14:58,400 --> 00:14:59,694
Let me help you, Yugi.

265
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:01,257
We can defeat her together.

266
00:15:01,340 --> 00:15:03,869
Now your imp's gonna
feel my Harpy's sting.

267
00:15:04,380 --> 00:15:05,321
Whiplash attack!

268
00:15:10,660 --> 00:15:12,980
That's nothing, Yugi. Stick around.

269
00:15:13,220 --> 00:15:14,577
The fun's just beginning.

270
00:15:14,660 --> 00:15:16,657
Looks like Mai's really got Yugi rattled.

271
00:15:16,740 --> 00:15:17,720
Watch it, Yug.

272
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:21,640
Mai's gonna try to multiply our
harpy lady next. Don't let her.

273
00:15:21,940 --> 00:15:23,640
Yugi, don't give up!

274
00:15:23,860 --> 00:15:25,566
I've got to turn this around.

275
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:26,960
But how?

276
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:30,097
Mai's playing brilliantly
while my attention is divided.

277
00:15:30,180 --> 00:15:34,592
You promised you'd try harder, Yugi,
but I see now that's not gonna happen.

278
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,620
Hmm, what have we here?

279
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:42,337
Well, with this card, my harpy
combo won't be quite complete.

280
00:15:42,420 --> 00:15:46,832
But it'll give me more than enough
power to vaporize that grungy old skull.

281
00:15:47,380 --> 00:15:51,160
Allow me to introduce the
ever-faithful servant of Harpy Lady.

282
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,200
What is that?

283
00:15:59,260 --> 00:16:01,680
Harpy's oh-so-cuddly pet dragon.

284
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:03,517
Sweet as a kitten, isn't he?

285
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:05,897
Well, sweet as a
fire-breathing kitty can be.

286
00:16:05,980 --> 00:16:09,897
And he gets 300 more attack points
just by sitting near his master.

287
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:10,810
Now!

288
00:16:10,893 --> 00:16:12,249
Blast that skull to ashes!

289
00:16:12,420 --> 00:16:14,240
Fearsome Fire Blast!

290
00:16:17,340 --> 00:16:18,170
No!

291
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:26,680
Harvey's Pet Dragon, attack!

292
00:16:30,540 --> 00:16:32,160
I summoned Skull!

293
00:16:32,420 --> 00:16:37,302
I told you, you've got to concentrate if
you're going to stand a chance against me.

294
00:16:38,020 --> 00:16:40,297
Why are you playing so poorly, Yugi?

295
00:16:40,380 --> 00:16:43,637
I've got you on the ropes, and
you're barely putting up a fight.

296
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:47,917
I want to duel you at your best, but
there's only so far I'm willing to go.

297
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:53,260
You know, I remember Joey once asked me
an important question about why I duel.

298
00:16:53,520 --> 00:16:56,344
The answer I gave him was
frivolous, but honest.

299
00:16:56,700 --> 00:16:58,960
Can you answer the question, Yugi?

300
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:02,160
I'm dueling for my grandfather, Mai.

301
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:05,897
Hey, he's got a heck of a lot
better answer than you did, Mai.

302
00:17:05,980 --> 00:17:08,977
Listen, me and Yugi aren't just
dueling for ourselves, you know.

303
00:17:09,060 --> 00:17:10,880
Well, that's what you say.

304
00:17:11,280 --> 00:17:14,937
But tell me, could it be your
motives aren't entirely unselfish?

305
00:17:15,020 --> 00:17:15,850
Huh?

306
00:17:15,933 --> 00:17:16,763
What are you saying, Mai?

307
00:17:16,846 --> 00:17:18,417
That maybe we should be more like you?

308
00:17:18,500 --> 00:17:20,237
Well, I guess we could do that.

309
00:17:20,320 --> 00:17:21,160
I'm gorgeous.

310
00:17:21,300 --> 00:17:22,457
I'm such a great duelist.

311
00:17:22,540 --> 00:17:24,300
I love me. How's that?

312
00:17:24,500 --> 00:17:26,220
You are such a twit.

313
00:17:26,860 --> 00:17:29,457
Joey, can't you see I'm
trying to be serious?

314
00:17:29,540 --> 00:17:32,840
I can see you trying to
seriously mess with Yuki's head.

315
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:37,024
And you're making him and me and
everybody crazy and dizzy and...

316
00:17:41,280 --> 00:17:48,017
will you control yourself you're wrong
joey i'm not trying to confuse yugi and

317
00:17:48,100 --> 00:17:53,677
you're off kilter enough without any help
from me something's happened to yugi and

318
00:17:53,760 --> 00:17:58,517
he'll need more than his friendship with
all of you to snap him out of it there's

319
00:17:58,600 --> 00:18:03,980
only so much i can do i may admire yugi
but I'm still determined to win this duel.

320
00:18:06,900 --> 00:18:08,497
Mai's right about one thing.

321
00:18:08,580 --> 00:18:10,697
I can't afford to be distracted now.

322
00:18:10,780 --> 00:18:13,015
Winning this duel is all that matters.

323
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:15,990
Yes!

324
00:18:16,073 --> 00:18:17,080
The Dark Magician!

325
00:18:17,300 --> 00:18:21,317
This card would definitely be powerful
enough to defeat Harpy's pet dragon.

326
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,660
If I could attack.

327
00:18:22,940 --> 00:18:23,900
But I can't.

328
00:18:24,140 --> 00:18:27,357
Not while Mai's Mirror Wall
Trap card is still in play.

329
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:28,734
I need another tactic.

330
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:30,237
Wait, I know.

331
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:32,600
I'll match her trap for trap.

332
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:38,920
I'll lay one card face down and then
throw Dark Magician in defense mode.

333
00:18:40,980 --> 00:18:42,560
That ends my turn.

334
00:18:43,060 --> 00:18:44,700
Come on, Mai. Attack.

335
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:48,377
I've matched your mirror wall
with a card called Mirror Force.

336
00:18:48,460 --> 00:18:50,578
All your monsters will be destroyed.

337
00:18:50,780 --> 00:18:52,080
Now it's my turn.

338
00:18:55,560 --> 00:18:58,520
This card will nearly
complete my harpy combo.

339
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:03,120
Whatever trap you set for
me, Yugi, just became useless

340
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:07,940
I play this accessory
card, Shadow of Eyes Huh?

341
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:09,280
The Shadow of Eyes?

342
00:19:09,560 --> 00:19:13,501
Watch the arena, I really don't
think you're gonna like this at all

343
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:16,040
What is this?

344
00:19:16,200 --> 00:19:18,820
My dark magician is
switching to attack mode

345
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:20,540
That's right,

346
00:19:20,940 --> 00:19:25,177
that's the magic of Shadow of
Eyes It exudes an irresistible

347
00:19:25,260 --> 00:19:28,731
force that can lure even the
mightiest monsters into battle

348
00:19:31,340 --> 00:19:33,811
Mai's trying to force Yugi into attacking.

349
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:37,417
That means that throwing monsters
in defense mode is useless, too.

350
00:19:37,500 --> 00:19:40,029
So what are you waiting
for, Dark Magician?

351
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:41,740
Attack Harpy Lady!

352
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:54,297
And I know that you played a trap card.

353
00:19:54,380 --> 00:19:56,360
So Harpy's Feather Duster.

354
00:19:56,580 --> 00:19:58,200
Give him a dusting off.

355
00:20:02,280 --> 00:20:03,110
Go!

356
00:20:03,193 --> 00:20:05,077
She's eliminated my Mirror Force card.

357
00:20:05,160 --> 00:20:08,260
Now to blow some extra
smoke your way. Dragon!

358
00:20:08,460 --> 00:20:09,940
Fearsome Tile Class!

359
00:20:18,040 --> 00:20:21,697
You don't even have your favorite
card, the Dark Magician, left.

360
00:20:21,780 --> 00:20:22,957
What are you gonna do now?

361
00:20:23,040 --> 00:20:25,040
Yeah, what is Yugi gonna do now?

362
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:28,640
Yugi, you can still turn
this around. I know you can.

363
00:20:28,780 --> 00:20:30,900
Uh, yeah, it only looks hopeless.

364
00:20:33,580 --> 00:20:35,460
I can't lose this match.

365
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:37,340
Yugi, let me help you.

366
00:20:37,580 --> 00:20:40,462
If you continue to hold
me back, everybody loses.
